  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU Support for Sustainable and Innovative Social Protection Programmes (SUSI) in Nigeria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The Action is part of, and contributes to the initiative to enable refugees, internally displaced persons, and people in host communities to live in safety and dignity as well as demonstrate the European Union social protection initiative in action. The &lt;strong&gt;Overall Objective&lt;/strong&gt; of the Action is that social protection in Nigeria is improved. The &lt;strong&gt;Specific Objective&lt;/strong&gt; (outcome) of the Action is that the social safety net system is used in selected States to reduce the burden of poverty and hunger amongst vulnerable communities, and in particular among women, girls and youth. The project would intentionally support communities that are impacted by Climate Change.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
